OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSome heavy
OL,6,Fshowers at first this evening, perhaps
OL,7,Fthundery over southern Aberdeenshire,
OL,8,Fbut turning lighter through evening.
OL,9,FOvernight staying mostly cloudy, some
OL,10,Fshowers mainly over Moray and northern
OL,11,FAberdeenshire.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FA cool and rather cloudy day
OL,14,Fwith occasional showers, more frequent
OL,15,Facross the north. A few sunny
OL,16,Fintervals. Moderate northerly breeze,
OL,17,Ffresh around Buchan coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
