OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FFriday
OL,6,Fcloudy with some light showers.
OL,7,FBrighter with some sunshine on
OL,8,FSaturday, but cloudier later, the odd
OL,9,Fshower. Sunday mainly cloudy perhaps
OL,10,Fsome patchy light rain.
